From 881248c4044d5e6b02ec16fb1c78506258cec103 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 02:29:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Transporter Config: eject colour, strict input, transmitter
 colour (API 54)

world.set-item-eject-color, set-item-strict-input and set-transmitter-color
keep Mekanism's Transporter Config in the block entities. Item networks route
by colour: a stack put in by a block ejecting with a colour carries it,
passes plain transporters and those of its colour (a plain stack plain ones
only, network::reachable_ends), and a strict block takes only its own
colour. None of it applies while ejection is off. Harness item-transport.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RYe92n7spgy8vtm4CovRWA
